{"id":"19.01.TapBlock.air","contentHtml":"<p>This project is practical <strong>proof of the flexibility and modularity</strong> of the architecture designed for <code>Tap Circle.air</code>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As a <strong>Solo Developer</strong>, I was responsible for 100% of the implementation: from integrating new mechanics to creating all assets unique to this project.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key task was <strong>architectural</strong>: to take the existing base (meta-game, services, UI) from <code>Tap Circle.air</code> and build a <strong>completely new core mechanic</strong> on it to prove the modularity and reusability of my code.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Architecture Reuse:</strong> Successfully reused all key modules: <strong>meta-game</strong> (store), <strong>services</strong> (<code>Google Play Games</code>), and <strong>UI/save system</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>New Core Mechanics:</strong> On this base, a different gameplay was implemented from scratch: <code>tap-to-fly</code> arcade with <strong>different types of platforms</strong> (dangerous, physical, reward) and a \"juicy\" <strong>combo system</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Independent Development:</strong> All new assets for this game were created: graphics, UI, <code>VFX</code>, and sounds.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Architecture Proved Flexibility:</strong> The experiment was successful — a completely new game was quickly built on the existing base.</li>\n<li><strong>Second Completed Product Created:</strong> Based on the framework, another full-fledged, release-ready game with thoughtful gameplay was created.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Competency:</strong> This case of two games proves the ability to <mark>not just write code, but design scalable, reusable systems</mark> — a key skill for a Senior/Lead developer.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Tap Block.air","date":"2019-01","type":"project","tagsArray":["Mobile","Arcade","Unity","C#","Photoshop","VFX"],"heroVideo":["aKvEuhtOLs4"],"shortDescription":"<p><mark>Successful stress test of my architecture</mark>: a completely new game rapidly built on the flexible framework derived from Tap Circle.air.</p>\n","role":"solo","storeLinks":["16.09.Realoft"],"projectIcon":"/images/projects/19.01.TapBlock.air/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/19.01.TapBlock.air/card.mp4?v=1765047017110","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/19.01.TapBlock.air/screenshots/1.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/19.01.TapBlock.air/screenshots/2.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/19.01.TapBlock.air/screenshots/3.webp","width":528,"height":944},{"src":"/images/projects/19.01.TapBlock.air/screenshots/4.webp","width":528,"height":944}]}